Read this file for instructions

Create new python environment
1. Terminal > python -m venv venv
2. venv/Scripts/Activate

Installing pre-requisites
1. Terminal > pip install -r requirements.txt
2. streamlit app.py to run the file

Switch your branch to dev
1. git checkout dev
2. git branch (check if you're in dev)
Please DO NOT push to master branch. Dev branch is all for testing purposes.

Steps to push code to GitHub
1. git status
2. git add (file name)
3. git commit -m "Add your comments here"
4. git push -u origin dev
